    "notes": [
      "CHILDREN LIST OVER-COUNTED (research 2026-07-03, open question): WikiTree (Pine-33) and a New York Genealogical & Biographical Society article (\"James Pyne (Pine) of Hempstead...\") list nine children for this well-documented immigrant (b. 1630 Exeter, Devon; d. 1686 Hempstead, NY) — Nathaniel, John, Susanna (m. Searing), James, Samuel, Jonathan, Leah (m. Williams), Sarah, and William. This tree lists twelve, including a duplicated \"Jonathan Pine\" entry and two names (Agnes, Benjamin) not found in the published sources. The duplicate Jonathan is likely a double-listing of the same child; Agnes and Benjamin are uncorroborated by sources checked this pass — not resolved either way."
    ]
  }
